WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.260
- [Kelly] Social media is
filled with tons of great posts.

00:00:02.260 --> 00:00:04.410
My job is to make sure
you don't miss the best.

00:00:04.410 --> 00:00:05.800
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:08.383
(upbeat music)

00:00:09.542 --> 00:00:11.300
7 year old Rowan wants to make sure

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:13.690
other kids never feel
alone in their worries.

00:00:13.690 --> 00:00:15.100
This video makes me cry every time.

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:17.710
So he's been making videos
to uplift his friends and

00:00:17.710 --> 00:00:19.979
classmates with his
impressive words of wisdom.

00:00:19.979 --> 00:00:22.200
Just check him out in action.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:25.890
- [Rowan] Hey second grade
friends before we was

00:00:25.890 --> 00:00:28.230
in first grade. But now, since we're going

00:00:28.230 --> 00:00:31.040
into second grade, I want you guys to know

00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:33.050
that it's going to be really fun,

00:00:33.050 --> 00:00:36.990
but make sure you be kind, not be rude,

00:00:36.990 --> 00:00:40.808
don't be obnoxious or anything like that.

00:00:40.808 --> 00:00:43.448
And believe in yourself.

00:00:43.448 --> 00:00:45.640
- (crowd cheers)

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:47.010
- I love that he said "obnoxious"

00:00:47.010 --> 00:00:48.380
'cause you can tell he's heard a parent

00:00:48.380 --> 00:00:50.002
say that or something.
(laughs) That's awesome.

00:00:50.002 --> 00:00:52.242
He's such an old soul,
right? He's so cute.

00:00:52.242 --> 00:00:55.900
We have Rowan on the line,
along with his mama, Michelle.

00:00:55.900 --> 00:00:57.660
So Rowan, what's up?

00:00:58.520 --> 00:01:00.580
- [Michelle] Hi

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:04.970
- So Rowan, what inspired you
to start making these videos?

00:01:04.970 --> 00:01:08.150
- Well, I used to be picked on in school

00:01:08.150 --> 00:01:11.736
about having a unibrow so I started making

00:01:11.736 --> 00:01:14.923
these videos and I came home crying to

00:01:14.923 --> 00:01:19.923
see mommy. And since we talked, we,

00:01:20.408 --> 00:01:25.408
we got to make these videos and
people got to learn from it.

00:01:25.773 --> 00:01:28.300
- And Michelle, you must be so proud.

00:01:28.300 --> 00:01:30.320
I was literally just talking
to Kathy about it's like the

00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:32.810
greatest compliment when
you know your kids are like,

00:01:32.810 --> 00:01:35.330
oh my God, somebody says
that your kid is kind,

00:01:35.330 --> 00:01:37.110
it's like the best compliment I think

00:01:37.110 --> 00:01:38.820
that you can hear about your child.

00:01:38.820 --> 00:01:42.031
- Absolutely. Oh my God.
It just touches me so much

00:01:42.031 --> 00:01:44.310
because he's always been such a

00:01:44.310 --> 00:01:46.461
sweet kid. He's just a sweet soul.

00:01:46.461 --> 00:01:50.351
He's an old soul and for
everybody to see it and for it to

00:01:50.351 --> 00:01:53.661
actually be helping other kids
is really the best feeling.

00:01:53.661 --> 00:01:56.161
(crowd claps)

00:01:58.221 --> 00:01:59.850
- Some of the videos that he's been doing,

00:01:59.850 --> 00:02:02.970
like they've had over 200,000 views.

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:07.090
People have been sending him
books about bullying and toys

00:02:07.090 --> 00:02:09.147
and just the sweetest letters.

00:02:09.147 --> 00:02:12.330
And it's the most amazing
feeling. I'm so proud of him.

00:02:12.330 --> 00:02:15.840
- I'm proud of you. I just met your Rowan.

00:02:15.840 --> 00:02:18.520
Well, Rowan, I usually close the show.

00:02:18.520 --> 00:02:20.980
I close out the show by
saying have a great day.

00:02:20.980 --> 00:02:22.850
And if it's not great change it.

00:02:22.850 --> 00:02:25.120
What would you say to everybody?

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:29.243
- Stay kind and there's
no beautiful without you.

00:02:29.243 --> 00:02:32.579
- I love you Rowan.
Well thank you so much,

00:02:32.579 --> 00:02:36.333
Rowan and Michelle I'm
liking your posts right now.

00:02:37.495 --> 00:02:39.100
- [Michelle] Thank you
so much, we love you.

00:02:39.100 --> 00:02:41.500
- [Kelly] And that's not
all. Our season-long partner,

00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:43.780
Pilot Pen, the go-to pen
of the Kelly Clarkson show

00:02:43.780 --> 00:02:45.846
likes to celebrate those
who create fearlessly,

00:02:45.846 --> 00:02:48.350
just like you Rowan. So there'll be using

00:02:48.350 --> 00:02:50.100
their friction erasable pen to write

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:52.318
you a check for a thousand
dollars. How's that sound.

00:02:52.318 --> 00:02:57.318
- (crowd cheering drowns out speaker)

00:02:57.457 --> 00:02:58.790
- [Kelly] Yeah.

